<!--
  eContract External Signing Coach
  Screen: 外部簽署 (External Signing) — DocuSign workflow task
  Layout: Two-column (60/40) mirroring the original UI design

  Custom widgets used:
    - ApprovalProgressBar  → top stage progress bar (起草送件→簽核路由→外部簽署→完成歸檔)
    - ProgressBar           → right panel signing progress (1/2 signers done)
    - Timeline              → Webhook event log (compact, right panel)

  Standard BAW widgets used:
    - Panel                 → section containers
    - Horizontal Layout     → two-column body + button row
    - Vertical Layout       → left/right column stacks
    - Output Text           → signer rows, envelope details, footer note
    - Button                → 重新發送提醒 (primary) / 取消此次發送 (danger)
-->
